<https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_alzheimer_disease_treatment> holon:hasQuestionText "What is the recommended first-line pharmacological treatment for Alzheimer Disease?" ;
  holon:hasAnswerText "Donepezil" ;
  oe:answer <https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/donepezil> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/alzheimer_disease> .

<https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/donepezil> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/alzheimer_disease> .
